sections.text:
Hoarse in morning. Asthmatic cough ;
worse night; lying on right side. Chest very tender.
Pain in region of heart. Expectoration, green mucus.

Useful after Colchic., fails in gout;
after Copaiva in gonorrhoea.

Compare: Nitric acid; Ammon, bens.; Sabina;
Tropceolum — Garden Nasturtium — (fetid urine).

Antidote : Copaiva.

Incompatible : Wine.
